WEBVTT - Accessibility: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.374
An accessibility report helps when every finding
points to the template that causes it.

2
00:00:09.474 --> 00:00:14.607
Accessibility: three skills for TYPO3 v14.

3
00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:22.137
Scans with Playwright and axe-core and names the
Fluid template behind each finding.

4
00:00:23.487 --> 00:00:29.482
The report lists each violation by page and
drafts the accessibility statement.

5
00:00:30.582 --> 00:00:38.249
Accessible patterns for Fluid, PHP and
JavaScript, with a checklist to verify by hand.

6
00:00:39.599 --> 00:00:47.083
When a screen reader does not announce an
accordion as expandable, this skill gives you
the markup that fixes it.

7
00:00:48.483 --> 00:00:55.235
Accessible patterns for navigation, filters,
tables, sticky headers and language switchers.

8
00:00:56.585 --> 00:01:05.427
It works to WCAG 2.2 AA for sitepackage
frontends, with a checklist for every content
element.

9
00:01:07.027 --> 00:01:11.271
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
